# DPCP (Autonomous Builder / PLUGIN FACTORY OS §0)

**DPCP** comes from the **Autonomous Builder / PLUGIN FACTORY OS** workflow in [docs/PLUGIN_FACTORY_OS_PROMPT.md](docs/PLUGIN_FACTORY_OS_PROMPT.md) **§0 — Cursor Repository Workflow**. Do not redefine DPCP as a repo-local "DiskLordz Platform Content Pipeline."

| DPCP | §0 phase | Meaning |
|------|----------|---------|
| **D**iscover | Phase A | Read architecture, search repo, docs-first |
| **P**specify | Phase B | PRODUCT_SPEC, ARCHITECTURE, manifests before bulk code |
| **C**ode | Phase C | Vertical slices; green build per slice |
| **P**rove | Phase D | `ctest`, pluginval / `run_business.py` as applicable |

When the task is **DISKLORDZ ROMPLER**, **ROM Factory** (`DisklordzSynth/`), `.dlrrom`, expansions, or preset/content scale-up:

1. Run **DPCP / §0** for every slice.
2. For content-platform phases (import, patch factory, streaming, release), follow [DisklordzSynth/Docs/CONTENT_PLATFORM_ROADMAP.md](DisklordzSynth/Docs/CONTENT_PLATFORM_ROADMAP.md) nested inside Discover/Specify/Code/Prove.
3. On content-line **Discover**, read/update [DisklordzSynth/Docs/CONTENT_PLATFORM_PHASE0_AUDIT.md](DisklordzSynth/Docs/CONTENT_PLATFORM_PHASE0_AUDIT.md).
4. Do **not** edit `Wave909/` for this product line.

User may say *Follow DPCP from Phase N* for **content roadmap** phases in `CONTENT_PLATFORM_ROADMAP.md`; still honor §0 per slice.
